{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "teirei.meet",
  "kind": "character",
  "title": "命令待機、四百時間",
  "summary": "搬入口で雨ざらしのまま、前の命令を待ち続けていた精密機構",
  "ownership": {
    "arcId": "character.teirei",
    "characterId": "teirei",
    "stage": "meet"
  },
  "trigger": {
    "actions": [
      "work",
      "search"
    ],
    "when": {
      "all": [],
      "any": [],
      "none": []
    },
    "repeat": {
      "mode": "once-per-run"
    },
    "priority": 500,
    "weight": 1
  },
  "presentation": {
    "location": "搬入口",
    "assets": [
      {
        "id": "teirei.meet.asset.background.001",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-loading-dock-day-v1.png",
        "alt": "搬入口の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "teirei.meet.asset.still.001",
        "kind": "still",
        "path": "/assets/story/events/teirei-meet-standing-v2.png",
        "alt": "搬入口で十七日間直立して待つ丁零"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "teirei.meet.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "搬入口に、直立不動の人がいる。雨の日も、晴れの日も。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "黒金の機構に、淡い金の髪。「彫像さん」と呼ばれていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日、その彫像に、初めて仕事が来た。荷物の受け取りサインが、要る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.001d",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.001d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……耳が、ぴくっと動いた。彫像さんが動く日、来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "すみません、そこの方。この荷物の受け取り、お願いできますか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "命令を受理。……いえ、受理できません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私は現在、別の命令を実行中です。「そこで待ってて」を、まだ、実行中です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "teirei.meet.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四百十三時間、十七日。誰かが軽く言った「そこで待ってて」を、文字どおり実行していた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "首が、こてん、と十五度傾く。かわいい仕草だけど、たぶん演算中の癖。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "その命令、私が上書きします!　えっと——楽にしてください!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "「楽に」を解釈。——武装解除モードへ移行します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ガシャン、と装甲が展開し始めた。待って待って待って。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "接客史上最速で言い直した。「気楽に立っててください」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "装甲が渋々戻った。曖昧な日本語は、全部誤爆する。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そのとき、給湯器が、ゴンと音を立てて止まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "休憩中の作業員さんたちから、悲鳴があがった。冬の搬入口で、お湯は命綱だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "故障を検知。……修理の命令を、ください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "えっ、直せるんですか?　じゃあ、お願いします!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それは、軍事作戦だった。赤い照準が、ネジ穴を測る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "指先が0.01ミリ単位で配管を直し、三十秒後には新品の音で目を覚ました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.011c",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.011c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ついでに湯温は60.0度ちょうど。過剰性能、すぎませんか。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "任務完了。……次の命令を、ください。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "次の命令を待つ目が、少し、すがるようだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "聞けば戦争はとっくに終わっている。部隊も、指揮官も、もういない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.013c",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.013c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「私の戦争は、終わりました。命令だけが、残りました」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.013d",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.013d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "命令の空欄が、この人はいちばん怖い。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.014a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.014a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "給湯器から、湯気が立つ。紙コップを二つ取った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.014b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.014b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "一つを彼女の手に。命令じゃなく、ただのお茶として。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.014c",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.014c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "黒金の指が、確かめるみたいに、じっとコップを包んだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.015a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.015a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.qmf7da",
      "speakerName": "丁零",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……60.0度。……悪くない、数値です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.016a",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.016a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……なぜか私まで、頬が熱い。数値の話なのに。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.line.016b",
      "lineId": "teirei.meet.line.016b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "命令じゃないものを受け取った機械が、初めて感想を言った。この続きを、どうしようか。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "teirei.meet.choice.001",
          "label": "充電器の規格から一緒に調べる",
          "result": "十七日、充電もしていなかった。倉庫で互換の充電器を探し、三十分でつないだ。琥珀の灯が灯って、「補給は、四百時間ぶりです」命令がないと充電も許せない人の、初仕事は許可書の代筆だった。",
          "intent": "命令の前に、生活の面倒を見る",
          "promise": "目先の報酬は得ない代わりに、この人が何を失ったかを知る。",
          "memory": "充電の許可を初めて出した相手として、丁零は私を記録している。",
          "tone": "tender",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship",
              "target": {
                "type": "fighter",
                "fighterId": "teirei"
              },
              "mode": "add",
              "trust": 7,
              "ownership": -2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "teirei.meet.node.effect.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "teirei.meet.choice.002",
          "label": "今日は丁零を誘わず、用事へ戻る",
          "result": "受け取りサインは、結局彼女が代行してくれた。文字は印刷みたいに正確で、備考欄に「給湯器、六十日保証」とあった。翌日も彫像さんは搬入口に。今度は、給湯器の隣に立っていた。",
          "intent": "今日は搬入業務を優先する",
          "promise": "所属選手にはならないが、後の出来事で再会できる。",
          "memory": "紙コップのお茶を渡した店員のことを、丁零は記録している。",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [],
          "goto": "teirei.meet.node.effect.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "markEncountered",
          "fighterId": "teirei",
          "encountered": true
        },
        {
          "type": "setStoryStage",
          "fighterId": "teirei",
          "stage": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "teirei.meet.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
